      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "This vector isolates the translational aspect of the node’s [`worldTransform`](scnnode/worldtransform.md) matrix, which in turn is the conversion of the node’s [`transform`](scnnode/transform.md) from local space to the scene’s world coordinate space.",
      "normalizedSource": "This vector isolates the translational aspect of the node’s [`worldTransform`](scnnode/worldtransform.md) matrix, which in turn is the conversion of the node’s [`transform`](scnnode/transform.md) from local space to the scene’s world coordinate space.",
      "sourceHash": "7c4c033fb33b446029222df68ec9b887cada242c4c5833ef1911a99e2b0e536e",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "That is, it expresses the x, y, and z offsets of the node’s position from that of the scene’s [`rootNode`](scnscene/rootnode.md), and is equivalent to reading the node’s [`position`](scnnode/position.md) vector and converting it to world space with the [`convertPosition(_:from:)`](scnnode/convertposition(_:from:).md) or [`convertPosition(_:to:)`](scnnode/convertposition(_:to:).md) method.",
      "documentTitle": "worldPosition",
      "framework": "SceneKit",
